      "comment": "ALWAYS A SMILE (7) finished in the minors last time when second (22.76) at Warrnambool making it two minors from two runs. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Has the ability and expected to go close. FROSTY FERRIS (1) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at his last four runs. Last start finished 2nd on November 12 over 305m at this track behind Brass Band beaten 1.5 lengths (18.17) in a Maiden. Well-placed to take this out. WAL TO BURN (2) is a handily bred pup making his debut without a trial. Can sneak into the finish on debut.",
